      "node_id": "kg_doc_6",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Title: Warrior (B.A.P song). \"Warrior\" (Korean: 워리어) is a song recorded by South Korean boy group B.A.P. It is released as a digital single on January 26, 2012 through TS Entertainment. The song served as B.A.P's debut single, the first from their self-titled debut album. \"Warrior\" was written and produced by Kang Ji-on and Kim Ki-bum, the same producers of Song Ji-eun's Going Crazy and Bang & Zelo's \"Never Give Up\". B.A.P's leader, Bang Yong-guk also participated in the song's production by co-writing \"Warrior\". The song's lyrics describes the injustice of the current society and how the protagonist's desire to end it.",
      "depth": 0,
